/mapped_variable.py", "line": 841, "comments": {"nodes": [{"databaseId": 4433150717, "author": {"login": "LucaKro"}, "body": "why is this needed? i think so far we always managed to get along without frozen dataclasses, what makes it this different here?", "createdAt": "2026-10-31T20:14:38Z", "url": "https://github.com/cram2/cognitive_robot_abstract_machine/pull/837#discussion_r4433150717"}, {"databaseId": 4443312256, "author": {"login": "AbdelrhmanBassiouny"}, "body": "This is because this class instances are each used as a hash key, so this eliminates by design any possibility that the class may mutate resulting in a different hash. it is safer.", "createdAt": "2026-11-02T14:04:39Z", "url": "https://github.com/cram2/cognitive_robot_abstract_machine/pull/837#discussion_r4443312256"}]}}, {"id": "PRRT_kwDOQga1Oc6yUR2a", "isResolved": false, "isOutdated": false, "path": "test/krrood_test/dataset/unhashable_call_arguments.py", "line": 1, "comments": {"nodes": [{"databaseId": 4433161335, "author": {"login": "LucaKro"}, "body": "what are those needed for (not saying you shouldnt add those, im genuinely curious what you will do with those and why they are needed)", "createdAt": "2026-10-31T20:18:36Z", "url": "https://github.com/cram2/cognitive_robot_abstract_machine/pull/837#discussion_r4433161335"}, {"databaseId": 4443334349, "author": {"login": "AbdelrhmanBassiouny"}, "body": "It's fine haha, I cache symbolic expressions by their semantic identity to prevent recreating them, this includes symbolic representation of calls, and this makes calles have a unique hash and a way to handle unhashable arguments. There's anoher usecase as well that is in coming prs related to EQL planning backend and state modeling.", "createdAt": "2026-11-02T14:06:32Z", "url": "https://github.com/cram2/cognitive_robot_abstract_machine/pull/837#discussion_r4443334349"}]}}, {"id": "PRRT_kwDOQga1Oc6yloG8", "isResolved": false, "isOutdated": false, "path": "krrood/src/krrood/entity_query_language/call_arguments.py", "line": 20, "comments": {"nodes": [{"databaseId": 4440332465, "author": {"login": "tomsch420"}, "body": "also use that in FactoryWithKWArgs?", "createdAt": "2026-11-02T08:41:14Z", "url": "https://github.com/cram2/cognitive_robot_abstract_machine/pull/837#discussion_r4440332465"}, {"databaseId": 4443315244, "author": {"login": "AbdelrhmanBassiouny"}, "body": "yeah why not.", "createdAt": "2026-11-02T14:04:57Z", "url": "https://github.com/cram2/cognitive_robot_abstract_machine/pull/837#discussion_r4443315244"}]}}]}}}}}], "job_logs": []}
